# Responsible AI Microlearning

This is a 5-minute microlearning module designed in Articulate Rise 360 to introduce learners to the basics of Responsible AI.

# Course Overview
- What is Responsible AI?
- AI Decision Flow (Input → Model → Output → Human Check)
- Common AI Harms
- Core Principles of Responsible AI
- Safe AI Usage Guidelines
- Interactive Knowledge Check

